  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "The table defines four priority indicators (CCA.1–CCA.4) for cervical cancer screening and treatment among women living with HIV, giving for each its reference number, short name, definition, numerator and denominator. CCA.1 and CCA.2 are marked as core indicators.",
